### Expense Tracker API - end-to-end demo script
### Works in IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code (REST Client extension). Run the requests top to bottom.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@email = riya@example.com

### 1. Register (returns a JWT). 201 Created
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "sup3rsecret",
  "fullName": "Riya Sharma"
}

### 2. Login (use this if the account already exists). 200 OK
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "sup3rsecret"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Anything without a token must fail. Expect 401 + ApiError JSON
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses

### 4. Set a monthly FOOD budget of 5000. 200 OK
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "category": "FOOD",
  "monthlyLimit": 5000.00
}

### 5. Create an expense well under budget -> event fires, no alert. 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/v1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 450.00,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "description": "Groceries",
  "spentAt": "2026-08-20"
}

### 6. Create a big expense that pushes FOOD past 80% -> WARNING alert appears in notifications
POST {{host}}/api/v1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 4000.00,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "description": "Party dinner",
  "spentAt": "2026-08-21"
}

### 7. Push it over 100% -> EXCEEDED alert
POST {{host}}/api/v1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 1200.00,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "description": "Weekend takeout",
  "spentAt": "2026-08-22"
}

### 8. THE MONEY SHOT: alerts created asynchronously by the Kafka consumers
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Unread badge count
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Paginated + filtered list (index-backed query)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses?category=FOOD&from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Monthly summary (single GROUP BY query)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses/summary?month=2026-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Update an expense
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/expenses/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 500.00,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "description": "Groceries (corrected)",
  "spentAt": "2026-08-20"
}

### 13. Delete an expense. 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/expenses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Validation failure -> 400 with a details array
POST {{host}}/api/v1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": -5,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "spentAt": "2099-01-01"
}

### 15. Latency proof: p95/p99 of every endpoint
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/http.server.requests

### 16. Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
